WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.080
AI alchemy is the practice of turning raw models into working leverage.

00:04.080 --> 00:06.240
A model alone is not a business system.

00:06.240 --> 00:10.200
The leverage appears when you add structure. Tools let the model act.

00:10.200 --> 00:14.320
Memory lets it keep context. Skills let it handle recurring jobs.

00:14.520 --> 00:17.080
Workflows turn output into momentum.

00:17.520 --> 00:20.440
When those layers connect, one person can move like a team.

00:20.520 --> 00:23.640
That is AI alchemy: working systems that compound.
